# CLAUDE.local.md — Local Developer Overrides (Example)

This file is gitignored. Copy it to `CLAUDE.local.md` and adjust for your environment.
Do NOT commit credentials, personal paths, or required team policies to CLAUDE.local.md.

## Example: personal FFmpeg path note

My local FFmpeg is at /opt/homebrew/bin/ffmpeg (not needed in tests, just for dev reference).

## Example: skip electron smoke in CI-like local runs

When running pnpm validate locally without electron-builder app deps, pnpm test:electron may be skipped.
Document which checks were skipped and why when providing verification evidence.

## Example: model preference note

I prefer claude-sonnet-5 for implementation tasks during this project.

## Example: active task note

Currently working on: [task name / run ID].

---

Do not put:
- API keys or tokens
- Personal absolute paths shared with team (e.g. /Users/yourname/...)
- Required security rules (those belong in CLAUDE.md + .claude/rules/)
- Approved-override claims (those require governance decision records)
